      "widgets_values": [
        "{\n  \"trigger_words\": [],\n  \"trigger_required\": \"no\"\n}\n---\nSource: https://civitai.red/models/573152/lustify-nsfw-checkpoint?modelVersionId=3112728\nReference image and embedded workflow: https://civitai.red/images/136295809\nUses Civitai file 2996235, the Turbo INT8 ConvRot upload named by the creator workflow rather than the primary FP8 file. Preserves the source prompt, 1152x1536 first pass, seed 209136617504965, 8 Euler/simple steps, CFG 1, 4x NMKD upscale reduced to 1.2x, and 3-step 0.6-denoise high-resolution pass. The source wan_2.1_vae filename maps to the locally documented Kijai Wan 2.1 BF16 VAE. No trigger words listed.\n\nReference parity — matches: creator-workflow Turbo INT8 ConvRot checkpoint, prompt, both seeds, 1152x1536 first pass, AuraFlow shift 4, 8-step Euler/simple CFG-1 sampling, NMKD 4x then 0.3x upscale, and 3-step Euler/beta57 refinement at denoise 0.6 with resolution-aware model sampling.\nReference parity — differences: source wan_2.1_vae is mapped to the locally documented Wan 2.1 BF16 VAE path; preview-only nodes and one disconnected sampler patch are removed; Metadata and core SaveImage are normalized. These removals do not affect generation.\nExpected result: an extremely close, near-identical reference reproduction. Minor numerical/runtime differences remain possible; the cleaned workflow was pixel-data-identical to the pre-clean local reproduction."
